# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vue 3 + Vite
# Copy this file to .env.local and insert your API key.
#
# Quickstart: Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
# 4. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and paste it below
#
# Production: Create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console with:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (New)
# - Routes API
# - Time Zone API
# - Street View Static / Maps JS Street View Service
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
